	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Commodum legi decumbens secundum Decadis 3. sermonem, et satis me consolatus est in misera hac <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>et lamentabili vita.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Iam iterum aliquot diebus domum non exivi, non uno morbo gravatus, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sed multis et eis gravibus, inter quos tamen pręcellit surditas.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Bone deus, quę <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>molestia hęc!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Orabis itaque dominum pro me, ut aures mihi reddat, nisi placuerit <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>aliud.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hoc uni tibi, quamvis res non queat esse diutius clam; nolim tamen <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>te esse authorem divulgandi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Placent reliqua, quę vidi in tuis sermonibus ita, ut agnoscam <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>te multiscium, gratia multa praeditum et exercitio scribendi tritum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dominus in te omnia <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>adaugeat teque servet quam diutissime incolumem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Iuvenis, qui has reddit, hactenus a nobis mea intercessione receptus, sustentatus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ac institutus est.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Rectissime se gessit, in literis profecit et prorsus inculpabilis est; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>velim igitur habeas commendatum, si qua in re tua opera sit opus illi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Novum: venit medicus cęsarianus<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">zu den kaiserlichen Hofärzten findet sich einiges in der Vesalius-Biogr. von Moritz Roth, z.B. (außer Vesalius selbst) Cornelius Barsdorpius/Baersdorp und Nicolaus Florenas; weitere Namen dort S. 203. 206. Siehe auch Mameranus, Catalogus familiae totius aulae caesareae [...] (Stand 1547/48), Köln 1550.</note> <placeName ref="l471">Spiram</placeName>, dixit se novam in corpus illius immisis<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>se animam; hinc certum, quod intra sex annos nullus gravis morbus sit ipsum invasurus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Cogita verborum absurditatem et divina.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Tantilla scribere volui, ne nihil scriberem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Vale mei memor.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName> salutabis nomine meo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><persName>Theodorus</persName>, credo, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sepultus est; <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanus</persName> vivit, sed non mihi.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> ex grabato valetudinario, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ut sic dicam, 18. martii anno 1550.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8418">Os[valdus] Myconius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>doctissimo, in domino suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tig[uri]</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
